WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.312
You have sent the report to both donors. Then a message arrives.

00:00:06.933 --> 00:00:11.541
Eighty-eight delivered. Not ninety-two. Who checks that correction? And who makes sure

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:13.461
both donors hear about it?

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:21.642
For a small relief team, the evidence lives with different volunteers. The

00:00:21.642 --> 00:00:25.957
coordinator ends up chasing the answers and keeping every report consistent.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:31.473
BasketBrief takes on that follow-up. Let me show you one complete week,

00:00:31.473 --> 00:00:34.411
with fictional people and a live Strands agent.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:40.806
The team reports twelve hundred and sixty dollars spent. Sixty dollars has

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:44.755
no receipt. BasketBrief reads the sources and finds that gap.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:49.940
Here is Rana’s inbox. The agent has asked her for the transport

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.813
receipt. Amal does not have to relay the question, and the same

00:00:53.813 --> 00:00:55.427
answer will support both reports.

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:02.760
Rana uploads the photograph. Nova Pro reads it through AgentCore Runtime. The

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:07.453
original and the transcription stay together so the coordinator can check what

00:01:07.453 --> 00:01:08.627
the machine read.

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:14.627
The evidence is ready. Amal reviews the report and approves this version.

00:01:14.627 --> 00:01:19.187
The agent can prepare and follow up; approval stays with the coordinator.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:25.908
The first report is now in the donor’s inbox. It records ninety-two

00:01:25.908 --> 00:01:29.539
delivered and eight returned. That copy will stay intact.

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:33.419
Now we return to that late correction.

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:40.438
Sami reports eighty-eight delivered. Four kits no longer reconcile. BasketBrief stops the

00:01:40.438 --> 00:01:45.363
earlier approval from authorizing this changed report, and opens a follow-up.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:51.306
This is the question in Sami’s inbox. The system keeps households unknown.

00:01:51.306 --> 00:01:55.545
A difference in kit counts cannot tell us how many people received

00:01:55.545 --> 00:01:55.899
help.

00:01:58.067 --> 00:02:03.351
Sami checks storage and confirms twelve returned. The answer closes the gap.

00:02:03.351 --> 00:02:06.875
BasketBrief prepares the amendment from the updated evidence.

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:13.164
Amal sees both changes before approving: delivered falls to eighty-eight, returned rises

00:02:13.164 --> 00:02:16.563
to twelve. The amendment needs its own approval.

00:02:18.067 --> 00:02:23.030
Northstar receives the approved amendment. The exact changes are visible, and the

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.099
original report is still there.

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:32.115
The Arabic donor receives the same facts and amendment. One evidence trail,

00:02:32.115 --> 00:02:34.219
carried through to both recipients.

00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:40.179
For your own team, each person signs in separately. New evidence creates

00:02:40.179 --> 00:02:44.621
a notification for the responsible reviewer. Donors see approved reports only.

00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:51.480
A requested receipt attaches to the original expense, avoiding a second charge.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:56.197
Multiple currencies stay separate until a reviewer supplies an exchange rate.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:03.852
Strands and Nova interpret messages and choose tools. AgentCore Runtime reads images;

00:03:03.852 --> 00:03:10.404
Memory provides advisory vendor history. Code enforces arithmetic, permissions and versioned approval.

00:03:11.633 --> 00:03:16.167
We tested the complete live loop, separate team accounts, and a private

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:20.701
Gmail attachment import. Our automated tests cover the boundaries. Field impact and

00:03:20.701 --> 00:03:23.345
time saved have not yet been measured.

00:03:25.633 --> 00:03:31.060
When the facts change, the follow-up should not depend on one person

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.225
remembering everyone. BasketBrief. Every correction deserves follow-through.
